   "text": "Treina o modelo\n(pontual ou quantílico)\nsó com o treino",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "p1",
   "originalText": "Treina o modelo\n(pontual ou quantílico)\nsó com o treino",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "kQsMi0pQcXu0Gw3Z2R6G5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 451.1331329345703,
   "y": 191.25,
   "width": 337.7337341308594,
   "height": 67.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "aR",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 814343836,
   "version": 3,
   "versionNonce": 154248348,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1790546099754,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Na calibração, mede o quanto\nele erra: nonconformity score\ns = |y − ŷ|  ou  max(q_lo − y, y − q_hi)",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "p2",
   "originalText": "Na calibração, mede o quanto\nele erra: nonconformity score\ns = |y − ŷ|  ou  max(q_lo − y, y − q_hi)",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "LoZklehGv3nCBhPU1h5wb",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 942.8321685791016,
   "y": 191.25,
   "width": 224.33566284179688,
   "height": 67.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": "aS",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 877310748,
   "version": 3,
   "versionNonce": 396198692,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1790546099754,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "q̂ = quantil ⌈(n+1)(1−α)⌉/n\ndos scores\n(um pouco acima de 1−α)",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "p3",
   "originalText": "q̂ = quantil ⌈(n+1)(1−α)⌉/n\ndos scores\n(um pouco acima de 1−α)",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
